  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1102.58 “Steps” means a series of horizontal surfaces used to ascend or descend. The term includes “stairs.”\n\nSource. #13198, eff 5-1-21 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100)",
